# Catalog authoring

- This vault is the authoring source of truth. Sync is **one-way**: vault → MongoDB by frontmatter `code`.
- Never change `code` after create. Folder moves/renames must keep the same `code`.
- `status` on concepts/questions: `draft` | `flagged` | `ai_fixed` | `approved`.
  - Learners see all except `flagged`.
  - After an AI fix, set `status: ai_fixed` only — never `approved`.
  - Only a human moderator sets `approved` (app or vault).
- Do not put board/grade/exam names in `Concepts/` or `Questions/` paths.
- Prefer README.md and Templates/ for note structure details.
